[STATE] the widgets container renders alongside the Customer information and Orders sections on the same profile page (not on a separate route) {OBSERVED}
[STATE] each of the 5 KPI cards shows a value traceable to salesRepCustomerOrderStatistics(organizationId: @td(ORG_ACME.id)) for this org, not a static/mock value {SPEC}

